# Cutting a Starred entry removes it with its children, and pasting it in the outline puts it back there, star and all.
file <<END
Work:
	- Report @star
		- Gather numbers
Home:
	- Sink
END
keys gS <C-x>
hide Report
keys p gh G p
see - Report 󰓎
quit
saved <<END
Work:
Home:
	- Sink
	- Report @star
		- Gather numbers
END
